Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.07,0:00:34.26,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ABERTURA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:35.82,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Primeiro, o horário.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:38.59,Legenda,,0,0,0,,GTA 6 libera à meia-noite, na virada de quarta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.61,0:00:41.25,Legenda,,0,0,0,,para quinta-feira, dia dezenove de novembro,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.27,0:00:42.72,Legenda,,0,0,0,,no horário de Brasília.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.74,0:00:45.15,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Só que o jogo libera por fuso horário, à
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:46.73,Legenda,,0,0,0,,meia-noite de cada lugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:49.33,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Isso quer dizer que quem mora num estado com
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.35,0:00:51.81,Legenda,,0,0,0,,fuso diferente, como o Amazonas ou o Acre,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.83,0:00:54.35,Legenda,,0,0,0,,entra um pouco depois, na meia-noite local.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:57.05,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Então, se o seu amigo de Manaus disser que já
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.07,0:00:59.36,Legenda,,0,0,0,,está jogando antes de você, desconfia.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.41,0:00:35.74,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · GAMEPLAY
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.99,0:00:39.19,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
