Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.26,0:00:59.73,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}O HORÁRIO NO BRASIL
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.84,0:00:40.44,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00428CFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}0H DE QUINTA
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.04,0:00:40.44,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}19/11, horário de Brasília
Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.25,0:00:51.85,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00D6E62E\shad6\4c&H40240612}FUSO LOCAL
Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.45,0:00:51.85,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}Amazonas e Acre entram depois
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.73,0:01:02.71,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Agora, a parte que mais importa para quem quer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.73,0:01:03.94,Legenda,,0,0,0,,fugir de spoiler.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:06.71,Legenda,,0,0,0,,A Nova Zelândia está dezesseis horas na frente
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:07.56,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de Brasília.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.58,0:01:10.38,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ou seja: a meia-noite deles cai às oito da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:12.26,Legenda,,0,0,0,,manhã de quarta-feira aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.28,0:01:14.49,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Enquanto você estiver trabalhando ou
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:17.17,Legenda,,0,0,0,,estudando, já vai ter gente jogando GTA 6 ao
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.19,0:01:18.31,Legenda,,0,0,0,,vivo na internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.33,0:01:21.13,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se você não quer saber de nada, a dica é
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.15,0:01:24.15,Legenda,,0,0,0,,simples: quarta-feira, silencia as palavras
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.17,0:01:27.16,Legenda,,0,0,0,,GTA 6 nas redes sociais e não abre a aba de
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.18,0:01:27.75,Legenda,,0,0,0,,lives.
