Dialogue: 2,0:04:02.83,0:04:06.23,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}GTA Vice City
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:30.91,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E onde tudo isso acontece: Leonida, o estado
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.93,0:04:33.50,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de GTA 6, inspirado na Flórida.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:36.34,Legenda,,0,0,0,,O coração é Vice City, a versão do jogo para
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.36,0:04:39.11,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Miami, com neon, prédios espelhados e praia
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.13,0:04:39.72,Legenda,,0,0,0,,lotada.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.74,0:04:42.43,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Em volta, a Rockstar já mostrou mais cinco
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.45,0:04:44.96,Legenda,,0,0,0,,regiões: Leonida Keys, as ilhas do sul;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:47.55,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Grassrivers, o pântano dos jacarés; Port
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.57,0:04:50.13,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Gellhorn, na costa do Golfo; Ambrosia, o
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.15,0:04:52.78,Legenda,,0,0,0,,interior industrial; e o Mount Kalaga, um
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.80,0:04:54.47,Legenda,,0,0,0,,parque nacional no norte.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.49,0:04:56.96,Legenda,,0,0,0,,A gente fez um vídeo inteiro só sobre o mapa,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.98,0:04:59.40,Legenda,,0,0,0,,mostrando o que cada região copia da Flórida
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:01.48,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de verdade, e ele está aqui no canal.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.49,0:04:33.42,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}MAPA
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.67,0:04:36.53,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}MAPA
